If this calculation is part of a bigger job, the other Health & Fitness tools on CalcHub can help. The [Calorie Calculator](/calorie-calculator), [BMR Calculator](/bmr-calculator), [Body Fat Calculator](/body-fat-calculator) and [Ideal Weight Calculator](/ideal-weight-calculator) all work the same way — enter your values and the result appears instantly, free and with no sign-up. For more detail, read the guides to the [Calorie Calculator](/blog/calorie-calculator-guide) and [BMR Calculator](/blog/bmr-calculator-guide), which explain how those calculations work and when to use them.

