- [Calorie Calculator](/calorie-calculator)
- [BMR Calculator](/bmr-calculator)
- [Body Fat Calculator](/body-fat-calculator)
- [Browse all Health & Fitness tools](/tools?category=Health%20%26%20Fitness)
- [More guides](/blog)', 'Health & Fitness', ARRAY['Health & Fitness', 'calories burned calculator', 'exercise calorie calculator', 'met calorie calculator'], 'published', 'CalcHub', '2026-11-17T04:41:25.562Z', '2026-11-21T12:38:31.138Z') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, excerpt = EXCLUDED.excerpt, content = EXCLUDED.content, category = EXCLUDED.category, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, status = EXCLUDED.status, author = EXCLUDED.author, updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at;
