A CSS property that draws a shadow around an element: box-shadow: offset-x offset-y blur spread colour. It is how cards, buttons and panels get depth. Try it with your own numbers in the [CSS Box Shadow Generator](/css-box-shadow-generator) — the result updates as you type, so you can test a few scenarios in seconds.

