- [More guides](/blog)', 'Conversion', ARRAY['Conversion', 'feet and inches to cm', 'feet to cm converter', 'inches to cm'], 'published', 'CalcHub', '2026-11-20T04:31:01.114Z', '2026-11-21T12:38:31.138Z') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, excerpt = EXCLUDED.excerpt, content = EXCLUDED.content, category = EXCLUDED.category, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, status = EXCLUDED.status, author = EXCLUDED.author, updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at;
INSERT INTO blog_posts (slug, title, excerpt, content, category, tags, status, author, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('field-goal-percentage-calculator-guide', 'Field Goal Percentage Calculator: how it works, formula and examples', 'Field Goal Percentage Calculator: Calculate basketball field goals made as a percentage of attempts. Learn how to use it, the formula behind it, a worked…', 'The [Field Goal Percentage Calculator](/field-goal-percentage-calculator) is a free online tool on CalcHub. Calculate basketball field goals made as a percentage of attempts. Enter your field goals made and field goal attempts and the result appears straight away — no account or download needed. Because it runs entirely in your browser, the values you type never leave your device, and you can use it as often as you like.

Calculate basketball field goals made as a percentage of attempts. This free online field goal percentage calculator gives you an instant answer without an account, a download or sending your entries to a server. It is designed for quick everyday use on desktop and mobile. This guide explains how to use it, the formula it applies, and a worked example you can follow with your own numbers.

