- [Test Score Calculator](/test-score-calculator)
- [Weighted Average Calculator](/weighted-average-calculator)
- [Browse all Education tools](/tools?category=Education)
- [More guides](/blog)', 'Education', ARRAY['Education', 'final grade calculator', 'final exam grade calculator', 'grade needed on final exam'], 'published', 'CalcHub', '2026-11-20T22:04:43.059Z', '2026-11-21T12:38:31.138Z') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, excerpt = EXCLUDED.excerpt, content = EXCLUDED.content, category = EXCLUDED.category, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, status = EXCLUDED.status, author = EXCLUDED.author, updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at;
