- [Temperature Converter](/temperature-converter)
- [Length Unit Converter](/unit-converter)
- [Weight Converter](/weight-converter)
- [Area Converter](/area-converter)
- [Browse all Conversion tools](/tools?category=Conversion)
- [More guides](/blog)', 'Conversion', ARRAY['Conversion', 'fuel economy converter', 'mpg to l 100km', 'km l to mpg'], 'published', 'CalcHub', '2026-11-17T03:41:25.562Z', '2026-11-21T12:38:31.138Z') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, excerpt = EXCLUDED.excerpt, content = EXCLUDED.content, category = EXCLUDED.category, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, status = EXCLUDED.status, author = EXCLUDED.author, updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at;
