If this calculation is part of a bigger job, the other Text Tools tools on CalcHub can help. The [Word Counter](/word-counter), [Character Counter](/character-counter), [Reading Time Calculator](/reading-time-calculator) and [Remove Spaces](/remove-spaces) all work the same way — enter your values and the result appears instantly, free and with no sign-up. For more detail, read the guides to the [Word Counter](/blog/word-counter-guide) and [Character Counter](/blog/character-counter-guide), which explain how those calculations work and when to use them.

