- [Square Root Calculator](/square-root-calculator)
- [Average Calculator](/average-calculator)
- [Browse all Math tools](/tools?category=Math)
- [More guides](/blog)', 'Math', ARRAY['Math', 'octal calculator', 'decimal to octal', 'octal to decimal'], 'published', 'CalcHub', '2026-11-20T04:01:01.114Z', '2026-11-21T12:38:31.138Z') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, excerpt = EXCLUDED.excerpt, content = EXCLUDED.content, category = EXCLUDED.category, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, status = EXCLUDED.status, author = EXCLUDED.author, updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at;
INSERT INTO blog_posts (slug, title, excerpt, content, category, tags, status, author, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('on-base-percentage-calculator-guide', 'On-Base Percentage Calculator: how it works, formula and examples', 'On-Base Percentage Calculator: Calculate OBP from hits, walks, hit-by-pitches and plate appearances. Learn how to use it, the formula behind it, a worked…', 'The [On-Base Percentage Calculator](/on-base-percentage-calculator) is a free online tool on CalcHub. Calculate OBP from hits, walks, hit-by-pitches and plate appearances. Enter your hits, walks, hit by pitch, at-bats and sacrifice flies and the result appears straight away — no account or download needed. Because it runs entirely in your browser, the values you type never leave your device, and you can use it as often as you like.

Calculate OBP from hits, walks, hit-by-pitches and plate appearances. This free online on-base percentage calculator gives you an instant answer without an account, a download or sending your entries to a server. It is designed for quick everyday use on desktop and mobile. This guide explains how to use it, the formula it applies, and a worked example you can follow with your own numbers.

## How to use the On-Base Percentage Calculator

