## What the result shows

With the default values (Hits: 150, Walks: 60, Hit by pitch: 5, At-bats: 500, Sacrifice flies: 5), the [On-Base Percentage Calculator](/on-base-percentage-calculator) returns On-base percentage: 0.377. The first figure is the headline result, and the rest break it down so you can see how the total is made up. Change any value and every figure updates instantly. If you want to compare with a related calculation, the [Batting Average Calculator](/batting-average-calculator) is worth a look before you finish.

## Tips

A few things worth knowing before you rely on the result — most of them are about the numbers you put in, rather than the tool itself:

