INSERT INTO blog_posts (slug, title, excerpt, content, category, tags, status, author, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('one-rep-max-calculator-guide', 'One Rep Max Calculator: how it works, formula and examples', 'One Rep Max Calculator: Estimate your one-repetition maximum from a weight and rep count. Learn how to use it, the formula behind it, a worked example and…', 'The [One Rep Max Calculator](/one-rep-max-calculator) is a free online tool on CalcHub. Estimate your one-repetition maximum from a weight and rep count. Enter your weight lifted and repetitions and the result appears straight away — no account or download needed. Because it runs entirely in your browser, the values you type never leave your device, and you can use it as often as you like.

Estimate your one-repetition maximum from a weight and rep count. This free online one rep max calculator gives you an instant answer without an account, a download or sending your entries to a server. It is designed for quick everyday use on desktop and mobile. This guide explains how to use it, the formula it applies, and a worked example you can follow with your own numbers.

