- [More guides](/blog)', 'Sports', ARRAY['Sports', 'ops calculator', 'baseball ops calculator', 'obp slg calculator'], 'published', 'CalcHub', '2026-11-20T03:14:43.059Z', '2026-11-21T12:38:31.138Z') ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, excerpt = EXCLUDED.excerpt, content = EXCLUDED.content, category = EXCLUDED.category, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, status = EXCLUDED.status, author = EXCLUDED.author, updated_at = EXCLUDED.updated_at;
INSERT INTO blog_posts (slug, title, excerpt, content, category, tags, status, author, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('overtime-calculator-guide', 'Overtime Pay Calculator: how it works, formula and examples', 'Overtime Pay Calculator: Calculate regular pay, overtime pay and total weekly earnings. Learn how to use it, the formula behind it, a worked example and…', 'The [Overtime Pay Calculator](/overtime-calculator) is a free online tool on CalcHub. Calculate regular pay, overtime pay and total weekly earnings. Enter your hourly rate, regular hours, overtime hours and overtime multiplier and the result appears straight away — no account or download needed. Because it runs entirely in your browser, the values you type never leave your device, and you can use it as often as you like.

Calculate regular pay, overtime pay and total weekly earnings. This free online overtime pay calculator gives you an instant answer without an account, a download or sending your entries to a server. It is designed for quick everyday use on desktop and mobile. This guide explains how to use it, the formula it applies, and a worked example you can follow with your own numbers.

