## Formula

A common running estimate is about 1.036 kcal per kg per km, broadly independent of pace.

That is the standard formula for this calculation, and it is the same one the [Running Calorie Calculator](/running-calorie-calculator) applies to the values you enter. You can work it out by hand, but the calculator is faster when you want to try several values, and it removes the risk of a slip in the arithmetic. If the figures look wrong, check your inputs first — a misplaced decimal point is the usual culprit.

