Here is a typical example. A 70 kg runner covering 10 km burns roughly 725 kcal. Try the same figures in the [Running Calorie Calculator](/running-calorie-calculator) and you will get the same result — then change one value at a time to see how the answer moves. The steps are the same whatever numbers you use; only the figures change.

